{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal Dungeon is a roguelike card game. Win every battle using only the cards in your opening hand to defeat all enemies in a single turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using as few cards as possible will earn you more rewards, and if you get stuck on an enemy, you can use money to shuffle and draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your deck using the money you earn! Defeat stronger enemies to earn more money! Repeat this process until you clear the dungeon!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344320?t=1754444261","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3344320?t=1754444261","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344320/7e8ee5c3a9c3f11c5753270e41d0c38047531ab8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754444261","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344320/7e8ee5c3a9c3f11c5753270e41d0c38047531ab8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754444261","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3921080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lethal Dungeon is a roguelike card game. Win every battle using only the cards in your opening hand to defeat all enemies in a single turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using as few cards as possible will earn you more rewards, and if you get stuck on an enemy, you can use money to shuffle and draw.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your deck using the money you earn! Defeat stronger enemies to earn more money! Repeat this process until you clear the dungeon!</p>","developers":["Nihohe Soft"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344320/12cd4d7ed23cfa5629a792